WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:06.720
Do I scare you?

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.060
Do you scare me?

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:10.860
No, you don't scare me

00:00:12.945 --> 00:00:13.945
Kiss me

00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:30.020
What were you saying about your mom?

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:34.460
I don't know, my mind's just playing tricks on me

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:40.900
There's something going on with you

00:00:41.715 --> 00:00:42.725
I'm coming over tonight

00:00:44.085 --> 00:00:45.740
Call her Ashley, she's here

00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:46.575
Mom?

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:47.660
Ask her again

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:49.680
Mom are you here?

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:51.400
Please mom I'm begging you, I want you in my life

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:53.020
Will you please come back to me?

00:00:53.020 --> 00:00:54.540
I love you, please

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:44.760
Oh my god!

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:51.040
Get her out of here! Get her out of here now!

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:21.140
In the name of Jesus Christ, tell me your name!

